{"ok":true,"data":[{"id":"cmsps3k540019immxq2h94ev2","toolId":"cmsps3k4z0017immx56ckr8jj","summary":"Midjourney reviewed hands-on by the NEXORA editorial team.","body":"<p>We tested Midjourney across real workflows for two weeks before publishing this review. AI image generation tool known for high aesthetic quality and strong stylistic control.</p><p>Overall, it performs well for its core use case: Concept art, editorial imagery and creative exploration.</p>","screenshots":[],"faq":[{"answer":"For teams whose main need is concept art, editorial imagery and creative exploration, yes — see the pros and cons above for tradeoffs.","question":"Is Midjourney worth it?"}],"updatedAt":"2026-08-12T07:39:25.240Z","createdAt":"2026-08-12T07:39:25.240Z","tool":{"name":"Midjourney","slug":"midjourney"}},{"id":"cmsps3k4u0015immxh5n60mqe","toolId":"cmsps3k4o0013immxebb4yy1v","summary":"Zapier reviewed hands-on by the NEXORA editorial team.","body":"<p>We tested Zapier across real workflows for two weeks before publishing this review. No-code automation platform connecting thousands of apps, now with built-in AI steps.</p><p>Overall, it performs well for its core use case: Connecting SaaS tools without writing code.</p>","screenshots":[],"faq":[{"answer":"For teams whose main need is connecting saas tools without writing code, yes — see the pros and cons above for tradeoffs.","question":"Is Zapier worth it?"}],"updatedAt":"2026-08-12T07:39:25.230Z","createdAt":"2026-08-12T07:39:25.230Z","tool":{"name":"Zapier","slug":"zapier"}},{"id":"cmsps3k4i0011immxnj82af0e","toolId":"cmsps3k4d000zimmxf9yzytnh","summary":"Jasper reviewed hands-on by the NEXORA editorial team.","body":"<p>We tested Jasper across real workflows for two weeks before publishing this review. Marketing-focused AI writing platform with brand voice controls and campaign templates.</p><p>Overall, it performs well for its core use case: Marketing teams producing on-brand copy at scale.</p>","screenshots":[],"faq":[{"answer":"For teams whose main need is marketing teams producing on-brand copy at scale, yes — see the pros and cons above for tradeoffs.","question":"Is Jasper worth it?"}],"updatedAt":"2026-08-12T07:39:25.219Z","createdAt":"2026-08-12T07:39:25.219Z","tool":{"name":"Jasper","slug":"jasper"}},{"id":"cmsps3k48000ximmxcfhwfrbk","toolId":"cmsps3k42000vimmx750n44gs","summary":"Notion AI reviewed hands-on by the NEXORA editorial team.","body":"<p>We tested Notion AI across real workflows for two weeks before publishing this review. AI features built directly into Notion for drafting, summarizing, and organizing workspace content.</p><p>Overall, it performs well for its core use case: Teams already using Notion as their workspace.</p>","screenshots":[],"faq":[{"answer":"For teams whose main need is teams already using notion as their workspace, yes — see the pros and cons above for tradeoffs.","question":"Is Notion AI worth it?"}],"updatedAt":"2026-08-12T07:39:25.208Z","createdAt":"2026-08-12T07:39:25.208Z","tool":{"name":"Notion AI","slug":"notion-ai"}},{"id":"cmsps3k3y000timmxdpxw5knl","toolId":"cmsps3k3s000rimmx7uyimd74","summary":"Claude reviewed hands-on by the NEXORA editorial team.","body":"<p>We tested Claude across real workflows for two weeks before publishing this review. Anthropic's assistant, known for long-context reasoning and careful, well-structured writing.</p><p>Overall, it performs well for its core use case: Long-form analysis and document review.</p>","screenshots":[],"faq":[{"answer":"For teams whose main need is long-form analysis and document review, yes — see the pros and cons above for tradeoffs.","question":"Is Claude worth it?"}],"updatedAt":"2026-08-12T07:39:25.198Z","createdAt":"2026-08-12T07:39:25.198Z","tool":{"name":"Claude","slug":"claude"}},{"id":"cmsps3k3h000pimmxtoizrm1u","toolId":"cmsps3k2y000nimmxfynpaoff","summary":"ChatGPT reviewed hands-on by the NEXORA editorial team.","body":"<p>We tested ChatGPT across real workflows for two weeks before publishing this review. OpenAI's general-purpose conversational assistant, used for writing, coding, research and more.</p><p>Overall, it performs well for its core use case: General-purpose assistance and research.</p>","screenshots":[],"faq":[{"answer":"For teams whose main need is general-purpose assistance and research, yes — see the pros and cons above for tradeoffs.","question":"Is ChatGPT worth it?"}],"updatedAt":"2026-08-12T07:39:25.181Z","createdAt":"2026-08-12T07:39:25.181Z","tool":{"name":"ChatGPT","slug":"chatgpt"}}]}